flowchart TD
 subgraph GOVERNANCE[Development and review - not runtime AI]
 AI[AI assists drafts / code / tests / documentation] -. proposals only .-> HD[Human reviews authority / units / time / binding / provenance / acceptance]
 HD -. decisions pending .-> RG[Versioned rule / implementation / evidence / approval registers]
 end
 subgraph BUILD[Build and release]
 Y[LinkML source modules and isolated approval definition] --> B[Build QA and pinned contracts]
 A[Amadeus code and label metadata plus frozen unit policy] --> B
 X[Optional external catalog] -. proposed and unimplemented .-> A
 end
 RG -. reviewed definitions .-> B
 U[User variables / dates / locations / paths] --> DL[Amadeus download]
 DL --> PR[Amadeus process]
 PR --> CA[Amadeus calculate]
 DL -. observe .-> RC[Explicit provenance recorder]
 PR -. observe .-> RC
 CA -. observe .-> RC
 CA --> EX[Post-calculation export]
 RC --> EX
 B --> EX
 EX --> V[Actual source / request / units / schema / lineage checks]
 V -. observed outcomes .-> RG
 V --> PQ[Typed Parquet and readback]
 PQ --> DB[DuckDB load / 102 SQL / fidelity / reopen]
 DB --> MF[Manifest binds files / receipts / release / instance]
 MF --> RO[Read-only critical files]
 RO --> WF[Workflow completion binds manifest SHA]
 WF --> LP[Final LATEST pointer]
 LP --> OP[Verified store open]
 OP --> Q[Read-only query]
 OP -. fail .-> REJ[Reject missing / changed / incomplete publication]
 CA -. separate QA only .-> CF[Direct NetCDF source comparison]
 Q -. evidence .-> HR[Human scientific review and independent replay]
 CF -. evidence .-> HR
 HR -. record actual decisions .-> RG
 HR -. pending sign-off .-> B
